concept:australian-citizenship-legislation-amendment-act-2002-sec-3-2 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "3 Schedule(s)"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-3-2 ;
    values:originalText "Each Act that is specified in a Schedule to this Act is amended or repealed as set out in the applicable items in the Schedule concerned, and any other item in a Schedule to this Act has effect according to its terms.  Repeal of section 17 of the Australian Citizenship Act 1948  Schedule 1" ;
    skos:definition "Each Act that is specified in a Schedule to this Act is amended or repealed as set out in the applicable items in the Schedule concerned, and any other item in a Schedule to this Act has effect according to its terms.  Repeal of section 17 of the Australian Citizenship Act 1948  Schedule 1"@en ;
